GSM Association - RSP2 Root CI1: the CI that issues the SM-DP+ servers' TLS certificates
(docs/AT-COMMANDS.md section 8). Its key ID 81370F5125D0B1D408D4C3B232E6D25E795BEBFB is the
production CI our eUICC trusts. The same certificate, SHA-256 of its DER
5E3E91FD454327C3AF5D32A7A73BBC59FE43AA7D85FD32D5DB44423F80A56BB3, from two sources read
2026-10-04: the Osmocom eUICC manual (docs/pki/ci/files/81370f.txt) and ChromeOS's Hermes
(platform2/hermes/certs/prod/gsma-ci.pem). Valid until 2052-02-21. A public certificate: no
secret here.

